Partner between it selecting trading advisors who will trade to maximize 
profits rather than to minimize the number of trades; i.e., it is in the best 
interest of the General Partner to reduce the frequency of trading to 
maximize the difference between the fixed commission and the share of the 
fixed commission, after payment of the round-turn commissions, the IB 
Affiliated with it will receive; (vii) the General Partner, should it manage 
